   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Substations \n Technical Procedure"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "rows": [
    [
     "Equipment:Air Blast Circuit \n Breaker 132KV 2PVT-145 g 630RADE KONCAR",
     "Document \n Number: \n CB-029-r0"
    ],
    [
     "Issued \n To: EHV Sectors"
    ],
    [
     "Status: \n APPROVED"
    ],
    [
     "Procedure: Major Maintenance Procedure (P2-Y5)",
     "Date \n Approved: 22 June 1998"
    ],
    [
     "Review \n Date: June \n 2003"
    ]
   ],
   "truncated_rows": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Introduction"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "This procedure details \n the items, which are checked every 5 years Y5. They include testing and major \n maintenance P2. In addition to the procedures listed, it is expected the \n checks, which are done more frequently, would also be completed at this \n time."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Safety Precautions"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Personnel carrying out the maintenance \n should be trained and qualified or directly supervised by some one who \n is."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Tools and Equipment"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Bituminous paint and suitable paint \n brushes for repainting the internal surface of the tank"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Special Safety Precautions"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Do not use the mobile crane for the \n actual lift, but attach a rope block and use the crane hook as a gin \n pole."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Environmental Recommendation"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "If you are going to repaint the \n outside surface of the tank by using spray gun for painting process. Try to \n follow the following instructions to reduce wastes and protect your \n health:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Recycle over spray."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Work to be Carried Out"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Inspect the moving contact (61 Fig 4):"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "If more than 1/3 of the contact surface is damaged it should be changed."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Changing the Moving Contact"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Inspect the segment contact (51 Fig 4) and its springs for this inspection \n it is necessary to remove the cap of the bearer (60 Fig 4) by means of a \n special pipe wrench."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Changing the Fixed \nContact"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Note:"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Closing time: 0. 25 sec, \n Opening time: 0.07 sec"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Record all results on maintenance card."
   ]
  },
